<title>JAPAN: Nihon Kaiheiki - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nihon Kaiheiki - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  4.28		vs	    4.23</p>
<p> Operating	  503    million	  vs	  480    million</p>
<p> Current	    474    million	  vs	  401    million</p>
<p> Net		  246    million	  vs	  236    million</p>
<p> EPS		   29.17 yen	  vs	   27.99 yen</p>
<p> Shares		8 million	  vs	   8 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nihon Kaiheiki Ind Co Ltd is a major specialised maker of industrial-use small and ultra-small switches.</p>
</text>
